  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regionalism in East Africa c. 1900 to the present</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Network promoting historical and contemporary political understandings of the East African Community and addressing the successes and limitations of regional integration to date. Benefits Kenya, Tanzania, Uganda, Rwanda, Burundi, South Sudan. SDG 16, 17</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
